  "description": "Trace any golf shot into a stunning clip — automatically.\n\nShaShot draws your ball's flight path the second you record, then lets you share it in one tap. The most accurate AI golf ball tracer, trusted by 200,000 golfers worldwide.\n\nWHAT YOU GET\n- Automatic Shot Tracing: your ball's flight path, drawn instantly\n- One-Tap Share: post your traced shots straight to social\n- Club Head Trace: see the exact path of your club head\n- Swing Tempo: find your ideal rhythm with the backswing/downswing ratio\n- Club Path & 3D Visualization: review your swing from every angle\n- Body Trace & P-System: check posture and every stage P1–P10\n\nWHY SHASHOT\n- Pro-quality tracing with a simple, intuitive UI\n- Trusted by 200,000 golfers worldwide\n\nStart your free trial and elevate your golf game today.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://underparlab.notion.site/Privacy-terms-b6758a65b6e74f89949483b642c01a36?pvs=25",
